                "description": "The Round Knob with Square Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. this stunning and modern knobset features a NEW style of door knob so that you can get that contemporary look you always wanted in a knob. The Modern Brass Round Knobset with Square Rosette is available in several finish color options. It will fit most standard pre-drilled doors that are 1-1/4 inches to 3 inches thick. It has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
